## STEP 1 — DELTA
- [NEW] `app.alfaview.com/graphql` — previously unmapped live **Apollo GraphQL endpoint** (SPA shell's real API). CSRF-preflight protected (`apollo-require-preflight`), `access-control-allow-origin: *`, **introspection disabled** (positive control). `__typename` resolves unauthenticated — server reachable without session.
- [NEW] Web bundle (`app.min.5b3949112f0cf682adc8.js`, 1.09MB) is a **guest-link + account/company management client**: GraphQL ops incl. `Signup`, `CreateCompany`, `CredentialsAuthenticate`, `MagicTokenAuthenticate`, LDAP auth, guest-link CRUD (`listCompanyLinks`, `BatchCreateGroupLinks`, `FetchGuestInfo`, `GuestJoin`), plus gRPC-web `BusinessLogicService` at `app.alfaview.com`.
- [NEW] `sso.alfaview.com/oauth2/register` **live** — returns stock FusionAuth error page requiring `redirect_uri` (`invalid_request`/`missing_redirect_uri`). Registration flow active; gated per-client.
- [NEW] Desktop downloads (`production-alfaview-assets.alfaview.com/stable/{mac,win,linux}/`) are **S3 direct objects** — listing/dir → 403 `AccessDenied`; no versioned filenames leaked.
- [NEW] OAuth `client_id` **absent** from web bundle (`clientId`/`oauth2`/`response_type` = 0 hits) → FusionAuth SSO client is **desktop-only**; web login uses GraphQL `CredentialsAuthenticate` (opaque tokens).

